# Plain Text

\\\foo at the start of a paragraph. .leading-dot remains plain. 'leading-apostrophe remains plain. Plain escapes: \foo, \\\foo, \\$, \\{. This paragraph ends with a backslash \\ Code: `. ' \foo \\foo \$ \{` and verbatim `. ' \foo \\foo \$ \{`.

```
.example-dot
'example-apostrophe
\foo \\foo \$ \{
```

```text
.source-dot
'source-apostrophe
\foo \\foo \$ \{
```